{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":578,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1918173,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":289277,"Name":"MrsProffitt2B","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1506636174,"LastPoster":{"Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1918173,"PostDate":1506636174,"PostContent":"Hello bridal world! \u00a0My fiance and I are wanting to start planning a destination wedding in the D...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelseakarp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.98.251.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1503968840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MrsProffitt2B","Id":289277,"Name":"MrsProffitt2B","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.98.250.164","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81135,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cc721f10efe51a07ce6e07b91bef17e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello bridal world! &amp;nbsp;My fiance and I are wanting to start planning a destination wedding in the Dominican Republic but we don&#039;t really want to do a resort wedding so we are looking at finding a wedding planner. We think it would be best hiring local, but I wanted to put the topic out there and see what kind of feedback I got from ladies who have done this before.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are there any wedding planners that you ladies (or gentlemen) recommend (or DON&#039;T recommend)? &amp;nbsp;Preferably ones that will work with budgets under 10k.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to see your responses!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918173,"PostDate":1506636174,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello bridal world! \u00a0My fiance and I are wanting to start planning a destination wedding in the Dominican Republic but we don't really want to do a resort wedding so we are looking at finding a wedding planner. We think it would be best hiring local, but I wanted to put the topic out there and see what kind of feedback I got from ladies who have done this before.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are there any wedding planners that you ladies (or gentlemen) recommend (or DON'T recommend)? \u00a0Preferably ones that will work with budgets under 10k.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to see your responses!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelseakarp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.98.251.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1503968840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MrsProffitt2B","Id":289277,"Name":"MrsProffitt2B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.95.180.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81135,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1eb373094875aeea86cbf184ea3854f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations and welcome to the BDW forum!! You&#039;ve come to the right place.&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Off resort weddings are very popular in Punta Cana.&amp;nbsp; There are several off resort wedding venues with very talented wedding coordinators in Punta Cana. We have been to most of them and have great relationships with them.&amp;nbsp; Please let me know what questions I can answer for you. Thanks! TA Patty&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you&#039;d like a BDW TA to contact you please click the following link:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG&#039; title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;?&lt;\/strong&gt;  We are an award winning travel agency and you can&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/&#039; title=\"\"&gt;read our reviews&amp;nbsp;here.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918174,"PostDate":1506636702,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations and welcome to the BDW forum!! You've come to the right place.\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 \u00a0Off resort weddings are very popular in Punta Cana.\u00a0 There are several off resort wedding venues with very talented wedding coordinators in Punta Cana. We have been to most of them and have great relationships with them.\u00a0 Please let me know what questions I can answer for you. Thanks! TA Patty<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you'd like a BDW TA to contact you please click the following link:\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><strong>?<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><spa