same? I&#039;ve had a few people tell me its different. I have two children who are 3 and 1. They drink alot of milk! I&#039;m a little worried if its different.\n \n Is there anyone who has travelled with babies or toddlers and noticed a difference? Thank you","Attachments":[],"Id":1107448,"PostDate":1270853690,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This might sound like a weird question but does anyone know if the milk is the same? I've had a few people tell me its different. I have two children who are 3 and 1. They drink alot of milk! I'm a little worried if its different.<br \/> <br \/> Is there anyone who has travelled with babies or toddlers and noticed a difference? Thank you\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shawnpembleton@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1249599069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220267.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Holly22","Id":220267,"Name":"Holly22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50594,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd259161d15a31c601d8a82bc86f6eea","RawContent":"LOL. I think its gross, but I&#039;m a huge milk drinker so I can tell the difference between any milk, So I might not be a good one to ask.","Attachments":[],"Id":1107466,"PostDate":1270854196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                LOL. I think its gross, but I'm a huge milk drinker so I can tell the difference between any milk, So I might not be a good one to ask.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courtney_la@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1243219728,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217797.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MilitaryMrs.s-to be","Id":217797,"Name":"MilitaryMrs.s-to be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50594,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56d4bf73c62607a993c034115363a30b","RawContent":"It does taste a little different, but it&#039;s not like goat&#039;s milk! It&#039;s pasteurized, so it&#039;s safe to drink, but yes, it has a &lt;i&gt;slightly&lt;\/i&gt; different flavour. If your kids are older and like chocolate milk, may-be you could bring some mix with you to cover-up the slight difference? They would never notice it if you did that. Besides, how many kids would turn down the opportunity to drink chocolate milk every day for a whole week! If you have babies and toddlers, I guess it would depend on how finicky they are!","Attachments":[],"Id":1107562,"PostDate":1270858889,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It does taste a little different, but it's not like goat's milk! It's pasteurized, so it's safe to drink, but yes, it has a <i>slightly<\/i> different flavour. If your kids are older and like chocolate milk, may-be you could bring some mix with you to cover-up the slight difference? They would never notice it if you did that. Besides, how many kids would turn down the opportunity to drink chocolate milk every day for a whole week! If you have babies and toddlers, I guess it would depend on how finicky they are!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Lucy & Tom - Married 24.11.08<\/strong><\/i><br><strong>Wedding Review - Dreams PC:<\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/thomasjsgirl-dreams-pc-wedding-nov-24-08-a-35102\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...24-08-a-35102\/<\/a><strong><br>Leftover Wedding Items FS:<\/strong><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f37\/leftover-wedding-stuff-56124\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...g-stuff-56124\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lucy_mazzoli@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.114.255.7","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208673960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209148.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Thomasjsgirl","Id":209148,"Name":"Thomasjsgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50594,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2696eeee92dc93a10c7ed55286d9c960","RawContent":"Thats a great idea! Thanks I would never think of that. They both love chocolate milk so I&#039;ll bring some just in case. \n As long as its cow and safe then I&#039;m happy. I never thought there would even be a difference.","Attachments":[],"Id":1107645,"PostDate":1270863253,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thats a great idea! Thanks I would never think of that. They both love chocolate milk so I'll bring some just in case. <br \/> As long as its cow and safe then I'm happy. I never thought there would even be a difference.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shawnpembleton@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1249599069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220267.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Holly22","Id":220267,"Name":"Holly22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50594,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e612ea5582b43b02679fbed935ae6aa","RawContent":"Hi, \n The difference is that they are probably using UHT milk, which is long-life milk that is stored in boxes (big juice-box style) at room temperature - I know that is what they have in Haiti (right next door) so I assume it&#039;s the same for the DR. The taste is slightly stronger than fresh cow&#039;s milk but it is cow&#039;s milk. The chocolate idea is a great one.\n You may even be able to find UHT milk at the supermarket here so you could try it out for flavour with the kids before going to see if it&#039;s going to be the cause of a major melt-down... :)\n Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1108871,"PostDate":1271001853,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, <br \/> The difference is that they are probably using UHT milk, which is long-life milk that is stored in boxes (big juice-box style) at room temperature - I know that is what they have in Haiti (right next door) so I assume it's the same for the DR. The taste is slightly stronger than fresh cow's milk but it is cow's milk. The chocolate idea is a great one.<br \/> You may even be able to find UHT milk at the supermarket here so you could try it out for flavour with the kids before going to see if it's going to be the cause of a major melt-down... <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> Good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"clairisse@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1243915706,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218015.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"clairisse","Id":218015,"Name":"clairisse","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50594,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a31875d02b63922e90ea078a4c3fc1ba","RawContent":"We have both fresh pasteurized milk in the regular tall 1 liter cartons in the refrigerated section of the dairy case, or the UHT (ultra high temperature) milk in the rectangular 1 liter cartons on the regular, non-refrigerated grocery shelves. Both are excellent quality, as are all the dairy products here. The varieties available are extensive. You can get lactose-free, skim, full-fat, 1%, soya milk, rice milk, flavored milks - like strawberry or chocolate, and others. Chances are you&#039;ll find one you or your kids will like, so no worries. Enjoy :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1114840,"PostDate":1271369376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We have both fresh pasteurized milk in the regular tall 1 liter cartons in the refrigerated section of the dairy case, or the UHT (ultra high temperature) milk in the rectangular 1 liter cartons on the regular, non-refrigerated grocery shelves. Both are excellent quality, as are all the dairy products here. The varieties available are extensive. You can get lactose-free, skim, full-fat, 1%, soya milk, rice milk, flavored milks - like strawberry or chocolate, and others. Chances are you'll find one you or your kids will like, so no worries. Enjoy <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vecinos.22@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1241314486,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217227.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lesandlynda","Id":217227,"Name":"lesandlynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50594,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"556420e0274a41c01ee0e8d088655757","RawContent":"Thanks for the tips and advice! It helps alot : )","Attachments":[],"Id":1115913,"PostDate":1271437381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the tips and advice! It helps alot : )\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shawnpembleton@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1249599069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220267.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Holly22","Id":220267,"Name":"Holly22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.98.250.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50594,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba41174da3eb434d2f553f7a3a733d4e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The milk in every country tastes different in my opinion. It depends on what they feed their cows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918170,"PostDate":1506635667,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The milk in every country tastes different in my opinion. It depends on what they feed their cows.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelseakarp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.98.251.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1503968840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MrsProffitt2B","Id":289277,"Name":"MrsProffitt2B","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"50594","Title":"Milk in the Dominican","LastPostDate":1506635667},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
