 next year, and wanted some beauty tips and advice from the members of this forum. I want a pearly white smile for my wedding day. But my teeth are kind of &amp;nbsp;discolored from smoking, and they have a dark brownish pigmentation. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.appletondental.ca\/services\/cosmetic-dentistry\/teeth-whitening\/&#039;&gt;I am thinking of teeth whitening procedure from a clinic at Whitby&lt;\/a&gt; ( Appleton dental clinic ). Does anyone have suggestions for teeth whitening products? Will my teeth become sensitive after this treatment?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915017,"PostDate":1469425336,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello, I'm new to this forum. I'm getting married next year, and wanted some beauty tips and advice from the members of this forum. I want a pearly white smile for my wedding day. But my teeth are kind of \u00a0discolored from smoking, and they have a dark brownish pigmentation. <a href='http:\/\/www.appletondental.ca\/services\/cosmetic-dentistry\/teeth-whitening\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>I am thinking of teeth whitening procedure from a clinic at Whitby<\/a> ( Appleton dental clinic ). Does anyone have suggestions for teeth whitening products? Will my teeth become sensitive after this treatment?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leahwatson562@outlook.com","IpAddress":"184.170.137.138","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1469421984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beewalk","Id":287447,"Name":"beewalk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"217.66.97.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80213,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"741b768c63ffc261303ff2972cac61e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I go to the dentist to whiten my teeth.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915412,"PostDate":1471958654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I go to the dentist to whiten my teeth.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roecamille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"217.66.97.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471934684,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Greatta","Id":287606,"Name":"Greatta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"103.76.253.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80213,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by udit, 01 August 2017 - 11:14 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1501658054,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc91d3200aa56f5663c7768af3dcfa55","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beewalk\" post=\"1915017\" timestamp=\"1469425336\"]\nHello, I&#039;m new to this forum. I&#039;m getting married next year, and wanted some beauty tips and advice from the members of this forum. I want a pearly white smile for my wedding day. But my teeth are kind of  discolored from smoking, and they have a dark brownish pigmentation. [url=\"http:\/\/www.appletondental.ca\/services\/cosmetic-dentistry\/teeth-whitening\/\"]I am thinking of teeth whitening procedure from a clinic at Whitby[\/url] ( Appleton dental clinic ). Does anyone have suggestions for teeth whitening products? Will my teeth become sensitive after this treatment?[\/quote]Brush your teeth with common salt and Mustard Oil. Home Remedy. Please brush Gently or you can brush with finger tip.","Attachments":[],"Id":1918010,"PostDate":1501658009,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beewalk, on 24 July 2016 - 09:42 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello, I'm new to this forum. I'm getting married next year, and wanted some beauty tips and advice from the members of this forum. I want a pearly white smile for my wedding day. But my teeth are kind of \u00a0discolored from smoking, and they have a dark brownish pigmentation. <a href='http:\/\/www.appletondental.ca\/services\/cosmetic-dentistry\/teeth-whitening\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>I am thinking of teeth whitening procedure from a clinic at Whitby<\/a> ( Appleton dental clinic ). Does anyone have suggestions for teeth whitening products? Will my teeth become sensitive after this treatment?\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Brush your teeth with common salt and Mustard Oil. Home Remedy. Please brush Gently or you can brush with finger tip. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding is a special moment and a <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pvcraft.com\/'>Wedding decoration<\/a> makes it exceptional moment of life. \u00a0\u00a0","Email":"seo@pvcraft.com","IpAddress":"103.76.253.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1500272107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"udit","Id":289130,"Name":"udit","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80213","Title":"Teeth Whitening","LastPostDate":1501658009},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
